    "summary": {
      "value": "Extend some of your psychic gifts to your allies."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Esper</strong>.</p><hr><p>Your <strong>gifts</strong> with <strong>event</strong> \"When you <strong>deal damage</strong>\" can also be used \"When an ally who is able to hear you <strong>deals damage</strong>\".</p><p>Your @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.skills.Item.aqgXqI567dkudwMN] <strong>gift</strong>, if you have acquired it, has its <strong>effect</strong> changed to \"You and every ally who is able to hear you may treat your Defense and Magic Defense scores as being equal to <strong>【your current Willpower die size + (the number of filled sections in your Brainwave Clock, multiplied by 2)】</strong> against that Check (you may still use your normal scores if better).\"</p>",
